# A will to sell goes to a trader who buys something carried
#
# will_sell_needs_goods.cli with the one difference that decides it: the hawker now carries crops, which
# are what the brewer buys. A catalogue is a draw from its tag, so the body carries the whole tag.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm hawking --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Hall" --period noon --grant-item apple,back_basket,net_bag,hamper,cabbage,carrot,dried_peas,grain,hay,onion,straw,turnip,wild_berry,barley,oats,rye,rice,maize,hops,olive,lemon,orange,mango,almond,coconut,grape,sugarcane,date,prickly_pear,baobab_fruit,banana,jungle_fig,cacao_pod,wild_millet,pear,plum,cherry,acorn,beechnut,flour

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

expect-state will will hawking steps=1
expect-state will propose to sell
quit
